WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
Many reports have standard paragraphs which you write again and again.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.840
By sending them to Quickler once, they'll appear in the Record

3
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.800
automatically when appropriate.

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.500
So your standard wording is always there, but never where it doesn't belong.
